{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11203170","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11203170","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1120317001:1":{"text":"제약이란 말이야, 전문적인 곳에서 전문적인 장비가 필요한 법이지.","source_cn":"制药这种事，还是要到专业的地方，使用专业的设备才行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2991276D09247B26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120317002:1":{"text":"마침 우리 집에 그 장비가 다 있다는 게 아니겠어~?","source_cn":"那当然就是在下家里的这些设备了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD88C7ACFC43A8AF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120317003:1":{"text":"저기 보이는 가득 그을린 냄비가 그 장비인가요?","source_cn":"你指的是面前的这口老旧的锅吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9CE7DDDEEE98DB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120317004:1":{"text":"켁, 얕보지 말아! 저 위에 흔적들은 다 제약에 성공한 훈장이라고나 할까.","source_cn":"不要小看它！这上面所有的痕迹，可都是成功药剂后留下的勋章啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x001767C363C12C94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120317005:1":{"text":"그 전문적인 장비들이 볼품없어 보이는 건 사실이네요.","source_cn":"那你的专业制药设备，看起来有确实有些不专业，还很简陋。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBC632B1DFEAA707","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120317006:1":{"text":"뭐?! 볼품없다니! 이런 걸 두고 간략화라고 하는 거야! 냄비가 쓸 수만 있으면 되는 거지!","source_cn":"哎呀，这怎么能叫简陋呢，只是比较简约罢了！而且锅这种东...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC73CFF8F9AB7BB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120317007:1":{"text":"에헴... 조금 전까지만 해도 “전문적인 장비”라고 하지 않았나요?","source_cn":"这个家伙……明明刚刚还在说什么“专业的设备”……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA390064F64DEC2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120317008:1":{"text":"쉿, 쉿! 본격적으로 약을 만들 거니 조용하고! 우선 구해 온 약초를 잘 섞어서 즙을 내고…","source_cn":"安静安静，我要开始正式制药了。这些是你们刚刚好不容易摘...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C40EE43A8A3AA02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120317009:1":{"text":"나만의 비법을 추가하면…","source_cn":"然后加入的秘密配方……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E5FD22E30F1F416","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120317010:1":{"text":"자, 누가 와서 이것 좀 섞어줘!","source_cn":"来，帮我搅拌一下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1A1733A10CA4F02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"s